<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ First to give timing of announcement at 5 p.m..</title>
<headline>NZ First to give timing of announcement at 5 p.m..</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>A spokesman for the New Zealand First Party said a statement would be made at 5 p.m. (0400 GMT) on the timing and form of a government coalition announcement.</p>
<p>NZ First MPs are meeting to choose a coalition partner between the conservative National Party and Labour.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
